Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:17.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,can just feel some you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,know trust it gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:20.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,some initial traction so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:21.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can better find a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:23.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,market fit It's like as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,a developer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:25.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,if I see this project is
